            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " has two attackers, your knight and your rook, and one defender, the pawn on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Your knight goes first: the pawn takes back and your rook takes the pawn. You have won a pawn. If the rook went first, you would give it for a knight."
          }
        ]
